Since your app is hosted on multiple subdomains:
^https://tdl\.(eservices|isource)\.fema\.gov/.*

Or if you're not sure how many subdomains you’ll hit:
^https://tdl\..*\.fema\.gov/.*

Exclude Pattern(s)
To filter out noise like images, fonts, and stylesheets:
.*\.(png|jpg|jpeg|gif|bmp|ico|css|js|woff|woff2|svg|ttf|eot)

You can also click “Add suggested Excludes” to fill these automatically.
